menu "app_cfg -- device configuration"

config APP_CFG_NAMESPACE
    string "NVS namespace for application configuration"
    default "appcfg"
    help
        Every persistent setting the template owns lives in this one namespace, so a
        factory reset has a single, auditable definition.

config APP_CFG_AP_PASS_SALT
    string "SoftAP passphrase salt"
    default "6cm63gj2OhKZWPbKZE1nSL7N"
    help
        Mixed with the device MAC to derive the provisioning AP passphrase. Change it
        for your own fleet: with the default, anyone who knows this project can compute
        the passphrase of any device from its MAC, which the SSID advertises.

config APP_CFG_AP_PASS_FIXED
    string "Fixed SoftAP passphrase (empty = derive per device)"
    default ""
    help
        Leave empty in anything you ship. A fixed passphrase is convenient on a bench
        where you provision the same board repeatedly and would rather not read the
        boot log every time.

endmenu
